  "cp30:5.1": "saddhammaṃ → sataṃ dhamma (machasaṃ)",
  "cp30:6.4": "vihiṃsitaṃ → ekaṃpāṇaṃ pihiṃsitaṃ (nāgā, machasaṃ); ekapāṇampi hiṃsitaṃ (sīmu)",
  "cp30:7.5": "rundhehi → randhehi (machasaṃ)",
  "cp30:8.2": "pajjunno → cahigajjiya (nāgā); abhigajjiya (katthaci)",
